File: shell.c
Line: 1313
Function: xmllintShell
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: In the 'xpath' command handler (when compiled with LIBXML_DEBUG_ENABLED), the result of xmlXPathEval is not checked for NULL before calling xmlXPathDebugDumpObject. If the user enters an invalid XPath expression, xmlXPathEval can return NULL, and passing this NULL to xmlXPathDebugDumpObject can lead to a NULL pointer dereference and crash.

